# ROVEXO Search Engine v1.0 — ABSOLUTE MASTER FREEZE

**STATUS: APPROVED UX CONTRACT · PRE-PRODUCTION · NO PRODUCTION DEPLOY**

SSOT: `lib/search/search-engine-v1.ts`

## Golden rule

User only **writes** what they want. ROVEXO does everything else.
Zero questions. Never ask category / brand / store / member / filter first.

## Idle (nothing written)

**ONLY** Recent Searches + Trending Searches

Forbidden idle: Categories · Brands · Stores · Members · Filters · Products · Popular

## Typing

Suggestions → Products → Relevant Categories → Relevant Stores → Relevant Members → Similar Products

## Filters

Available **only after** a text search (`q` present). Never before.

## Camera

Take/Upload → Crop → Confirm → Match → Products / Similar / Categories / Stores / Members  
No “what category?” questions.

## Four rules

1. User must do less  
2. ROVEXO must do more  
3. Show only what is relevant  
4. Never ask unnecessary questions
